OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABin collection review finds
OL,4,Aservice 'under stress'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA review into issues with bin
OL,7,Fcollections in part of East Kent has
OL,8,Ffound that the service is "operating
OL,9,Freactively" and needs to grow.
OL,11,FIn April, Thanet District Council (TDC)
OL,12,Fintroduced changes to the recycling
OL,13,Fsystem for 27,000 properties, resulting
OL,14,Fin an increasing number of missed
OL,15,Fcollections in Thanet.
OL,17,FThis prompted TDC to undertake an
OL,18,Finitial review, then commission an
OL,19,Fexternal review, the findings of which
OL,20,Fwill be presented to cabinet on
OL,21,FThursday evening.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
