OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABin collection review finds
OL,4,Aservice 'under stress'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe external review, undertaken by
OL,7,FCaneco, described an "under stress"
OL,8,Fservice with issues including
OL,9,F"increasing the numbers of domestic
OL,10,Fcollections", "growth in recyclable
OL,11,Fmaterials", and "increasing numbers of
OL,12,Fvisitors to the coast".
